hiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=6;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="en-65"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="420" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-67" value="&lt;b&gt;poi_category&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=28;fontStyle=0;collapsible=0;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fillStyle=solid;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#d0bfff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e1e1e;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="690" width="420" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ev-68" value="sight, temple, fort_palace, museum, market, nature, adventure, food, viewpoint, wellness" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=6;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="en-67"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="420" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-69" value="&lt;b&gt;review_status&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=28;fontStyle=0;collapsible=0;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fillStyle=solid;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#d0bfff;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e1e1e;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="690" width="420" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ev-70" value="draft, verified" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=6;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="en-69"><mxGeometry x="0" y="28" width="420" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t-71" value="&lt;b&gt;CHECK and UNIQUE constraints (beyond PK and single-column UNIQUE)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=4;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="110" width="1100" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ck-72" value="&lt;table style=&quot;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;trip&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;title length 1 to 120; duration_nights 1 to 14; budget_total_inr &amp;gt; 0; radius_km &amp;gt; 0; start_date &amp;lt;= end_date when both set&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;trip_member&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;UNIQUE (trip_id, user_id); partial UNIQUE (trip_id) WHERE role = 'organiser' (one organiser per trip)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;preference&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;UNIQUE (trip_member_id); budget_min_inr &amp;gt;= 0; budget_min_inr &amp;lt;= budget_max_inr; date_start &amp;lt;= date_end&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;past_trip&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;rating 1 to 5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;recommendation_item&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;UNIQUE (run_id, rank); UNIQUE (run_id, destination_id)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;trip_package&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;rooms &amp;gt; 0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;cost_item&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;amount_inr &amp;gt;= 0&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;itinerary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;UNIQUE (package_id, version); version &amp;gt;= 1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;itinerary_item&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;UNIQUE (itinerary_id, day_number, position); day_number &amp;gt;= 1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;destination&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;lat 6.0 to 37.6 and lng 68.0 to 97.5 (India); min_nights 1 to 14; cost columns &amp;gt;= 0; stay_budget &amp;lt;= stay_mid &amp;lt;= stay_premium&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;poi&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;UNIQUE (destination_id, poi_key); open_time and close_time both set or both null; close_time &amp;gt; open_time&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;fare_fallback&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;UNIQUE (origin_hub_id, destination_id, mode); mode = 'car' implies fare_per_person_inr IS NULL&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da;vertical-align:top;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;distance_cache&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;padding:5px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid #ced4da&quot;&gt;UNIQUE (origin_key, destination_id, provider)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fillStyle=solid;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e1e1e;fontColor=#1e1e1e;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1400" y="150" width="1100" height="370" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t-73" value="&lt;b&gt;Design rules the schema supports&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=4;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=20;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="838" width="1300" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nt-74" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Trip lifecycle.&lt;/b&gt; trip.status changes only through transitionTrip() (apps/api/src/trips/transition-trip.ts), which writes one trip_transition row per change (T1 to T18, T3b, I1 to I5). Never UPDATE trip.status directly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cascade on trip delete.&lt;/b&gt; Deleting a trip removes its members (and their preferences), invitations, transitions, recommendation runs and items, packages (cost items, decisions, itineraries and their items and decisions) and notifications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Catalogue is protected.&lt;/b&gt; recommendation_item.destination_id, trip_package.destination_id and trip.origin_hub_id are ON DELETE RESTRICT, so a destination or hub that a trip has used cannot be deleted; retire a destination with destination.active = false instead.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Group-fit score.&lt;/b&gt; alpha, beta and gamma are stored on every recommendation_run (from configuration, never literals); recommendation_item keeps mean, min and sd so the GFS is reproducible.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Privacy.&lt;/b&gt; preference rows are readable only by their owner (via trip_member.user_id); other members see aggregates only.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Provenance.&lt;/b&gt; Figures from integrations carry provenance (live, cached, curated, estimated): cost_item.provenance, recommendation_item.distance_provenance, distance_cache.provenance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Better Auth.&lt;/b&gt; user, session, account and verification are generated by the Better Auth CLI; app data about a user lives in user_profile (1 : 0..1).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0 0 10px 0&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Timestamps.&lt;/b&gt; App tables use timestamptz (UTC); Better Auth tables use timestamp without time zone. updated_at is set by Drizzle on update.&lt;/p&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fillStyle=solid;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fillColor=#fff9db;strokeColor=#1e1e1e;fontColor=#1e1e1e;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="878" width="2460" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
